Project (9).png", "id": "3487223478096508", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_3487223481429841_537881782271932544_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rvhrEIit4DEQ7kNvwETEtcg&_nc_oc=AdooMGOoO-4_Tj-GNrgTgz7vIdFS_WtDJ04oqVQFArIE1IXxu-T3v8kA6NiQrls_ruY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMLxTC7RGOF1T_VEfMyKi9NvFUeUPqRLPF754hCYmbcew&oe=6ACE3B03"}, {"file_name": "New Project (10).png", "id": "1247967664194423", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_1247967667527756_757513758820452002_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kke0kyNElAcQ7kNvwG4Em9D&_nc_oc=AdrN7MCKcjWB5DuW1LX6SFB6cVK9B8Sb_ldAapgRXn9ywvtJ7m-l-z7NBACBPcRqzAQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNGrlOV-9xOb2St8UEMJMMtaC3cMdN3CrHuAkL5ZxXYqA&oe=6ACE62C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gorilluh", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Gorilluh is a high-energy multiplayer movement game where speed, skill, and pure gorilla instinct decide who survives the chase. Using immersive, physics-based locomotion, you run, climb, vault, and launch yourself across dynamic maps \u2014 from dense forests and open beaches to social hubs and secret hangouts. There are no traditional movement buttons \u2014 your hands are everything.\n\nTag your friends, escape impossible chases, master advanced movement techniques, and outmaneuver opponents in fast-paced rounds full of chaos and laughter. Whether you're scaling massive trees, diving across sandy shores, or showing off in the shop area, every match feels different.\n\nGorilluh blends competitive intensity with goofy fun, creating moments where clutch escapes and hilarious fails happen back-to-back. Easy to learn but hard to master, the movement system rewards practice, creativity, and smart positioning.\n\nSwing fast. Climb higher. Tag first.\n\nWelcome to Gorilluh.", "short_description": "Gorilluh is a fast-paced multiplayer tag game where you swing, climb, and launch yourself across wild maps using only your hands. Run through forests, bounce across beaches, explore social areas, and outplay your friends in chaotic movement-based tag matches. No buttons. No limits. Just pure gorilla energy."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tYrOU2DlVX6jVcHFTsQu3mlzTTJfy-V1zYpVRG5jUkA/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Acitric", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gorilluh.my.canva.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25929388640048680"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819511_1860160914632839_4920214351803512899_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iDeRmWh5RyYQ7kNvwHiv68q&_nc_oc=AdqRA-d1MksWlmVwC19-jdWwMRKGuc5KhJz4hINpfVez40JRxOOnrck2Xyb5xrI9xWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNreNmd4MpAepTGMJMSOsh1EoLHHXksviYOuxQgPE9fow&oe=6ACE648C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Gorilluh", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"